---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Snowball Studio website."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">Last updated: April 29, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy applies to the Snowball Studio website
          (snowball.value888.site). It explains what information may be
          collected when you visit this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          This website is a static site. We do not use cookies, analytics
          trackers, or any form of user data collection. We do not collect,
          store, or process any personal information from visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may collect technical
          information such as IP addresses and browser metadata as part of
          their standard server logging. Please refer to{" "}
          <a
            href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-gray-900 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-gray-600"
          >
            GitHub's Privacy Statement
          </a>{" "}for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to external sites (such as GitHub
          or Google Play). We are not responsible for the privacy practices
          of those sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. App Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>
          Individual applications published by Snowball Studio have their own
          privacy policies. Please refer to the respective app's listing page
          or the link on our{" "}
          <a
            href="/works"
            class="text-gray-900 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-gray-600"
          >
            Works
          </a>{" "}page for the specific privacy policy that applies to each app.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
          will be posted on this page with an updated date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
          us at{" "}
          <a
            href="mailto:zhiweiyan.2020@gmail.com"
            class="text-gray-900 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-gray-600"
          >
            zhiweiyan.2020@gmail.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
